{"artifact_id": "EXM-04", "chunk_id": "EXM-04:sec:EVIDENCE_SOURCE_BASIS", "content_sha256": "d35a36c9667312ea36796ec7c276e0e21f68afeab59d306b75396ead55c0a0ce", "heading": "Evidence / Source Basis", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-04", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Evidence / Source Basis\n\nPrimary evidence: SRC-ER-4CH1 — the 2023-11 1C/2C and 2024-06 1CR/2C examiner-report\nPDFs of the pack (page-located excerpts from the commentary zone; per-file identity\ncarried by the paper-dir paths). Paper identity rides on SRC-QPMS-4CH1 per the\nsource manifest's limitation note. No mark schemes were consumed for penalty claims;\nthe examiner-sentiment substitution is forbidden and was not made."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-04", "chunk_id": "EXM-04:sec:LIMITATIONS_COVERAGE_GAPS", "content_sha256": "ab1dabb974665e2ca44aa28bbd50919fa8eb3fa4fb9801d37144e3ab3a163d29", "heading": "Limitations / Coverage Gaps", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-04", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Limitations / Coverage Gaps\n\nThe penalty catalogue covers the pack's excerpted reports (2023-11, 2024-06); other\nheld sessions sit in sibling packs. One quotation window is truncated by the excerpt\ncap (the notation warning's continuation is outside the window and is not\nparaphrased). Sessions without public ERs remain source gaps of record. No canonical\nplanes were written."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-04", "chunk_id": "EXM-04:sec:RESEARCH_STATUS", "content_sha256": "8aad38ee4b372ccb57a21fad95e355eda2592d03b381174895f58586e388585c", "heading": "Research Status", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-04", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Research Status\n\nGENERATED under SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005 (BL-008 pass 5) from the run's evidence\npack alone; validator of record tools/sib @ 357ace0a; claim QA r3 bound all citations\nto pack excerpts. Research artifact — evidence-backed, not canonical educational\ntruth."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-04", "chunk_id": "EXM-04:rec:EXM-016", "content_sha256": "61fd23e78bbdaa77c0216aca643c11ae46cf6f7b0ce17c98f9043ccd7daa408c", "heading": "EXM-016", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-04", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "EXM-016", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "EXM-016", "text": "### EXM-016 — Failed printed instructions\n\n**Claim:** not following an explicit instruction voids the intended marks.\n**Evidence:** \"A few candidates failed to follow the instruction to draw another four\nparticles.\" (SRC-ER-4CH1, 2023-11/4CH1-1C/er.pdf p3).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-04", "chunk_id": "EXM-04:rec:EXM-017", "content_sha256": "d8980c40b332e65bc8951e83a8fea9f07fb2679e7a880e2bd0fa967789148b6e", "heading": "EXM-017", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-04", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "EXM-017", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "EXM-017", "text": "### EXM-017 — Inattentive formula work and unclear subscripts\n\n**Claim:** organic-formula answers are penalised for ignoring the starting hydrocarbon\nand for unreadable subscripts.\n**Evidence:** \"Many correctly gave the formulae of two alkenes but some did not pay\nattention to the starting hydrocarbon formula and gave molecules that were too large\nor did not follow the formula for an alkene. Candidates need to take care to write\ntheir subscript numbers clearly wh...\" (SRC-ER-4CH1, 2023-11/4CH1-1C/er.pdf p4).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-04", "chunk_id": "EXM-04:rec:EXM-018", "content_sha256": "bf7bea3c4f40e825ffaec27f93342fcbd198b2053230fd987efa730ab6481287", "heading": "EXM-018", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-04", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "EXM-018", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "EXM-018", "text": "### EXM-018 — Method-reading failures\n\n**Claim:** not reading (or not understanding) the method's variable-control design\ncosts whole questions.\n**Evidence:** \"Question (a) was very poorly answered with the majority gaining no\nmarks. It appears that the candidates either did not read the method or did not\nunderstand the idea of keeping the variables constant.\" (SRC-ER-4CH1, 2023-11/4CH1-2C/er.pdf p4).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-04", "chunk_id": "EXM-04:rec:EXM-019", "content_sha256": "c6e0bb830a631b5d7174e4cae4e1b24172f097c65889823feeb5962f694397a4", "heading": "EXM-019", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-04", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "EXM-019", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "EXM-019", "text": "### EXM-019 — Unlinked statements in multi-mark explanations\n\n**Claim:** the reports tie lost explanation marks directly to missing links between\nstatements.\n**Evidence:** \"There were four questions with 4, 5 or 6 marks. All of these were\nexplanations. Many of the candidates struggled with these questions and only the very\nbest scored full marks. They needed to link the statements to gain all the marks\"\n(SRC-ER-4CH1, 2024-06/4CH1-1CR/er.pdf p3).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-04", "chunk_id": "EXM-04:rec:EXM-020", "content_sha256": "5f2558ddf08cbe0eb6975d81767ec48d914b938dcd869ef6f3d236f65dbe43df", "heading": "EXM-020", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-04", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "EXM-020", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "EXM-020", "text": "### EXM-020 — Quantity confusions: mass number vs atomic number\n\n**Claim:** reaching for the wrong nuclear quantity is a named, recurring error.\n**Evidence:** \"A large majority of candidates gave sulfur as the answer. Oxygen was\nseen occasionally as they were using the mass number rather than the atomic number.\"\n(SRC-ER-4CH1, 2024-06/4CH1-2C/er.pdf p4).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-04", "chunk_id": "EXM-04:rec:EXM-021", "content_sha256": "2454c87d01eb0f4ac18609fc65b79632108b5c8f242e2a2cd9366720b56b5cb6", "heading": "EXM-021", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-04", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "EXM-021", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "EXM-021", "text": "### EXM-021 — Notation misuse\n\n**Claim:** misused notation loses marks even when the chemistry is broadly right.\n**Evidence:** \"However, a significant number of candidates lost a mark as they often\nreferred to an incorrect use of\" — the 2C November introduction's notation warning\n(SRC-ER-4CH1, 2023-11/4CH1-2C/er.pdf p3).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
